    incidentName: Flooded Road
    chanceToHappen: 30
    incidentDescription: 'As you travel through a low valley your caravan is forced
      to stop as the road ahead has been partially washed away by a small flood.  
      With no other paths forward, and turning around being unfeasible, the members
      of your caravan grab shovels, steaks and planks and set to work repairing the
      road enough for your wagons to pass through the damaged section.   Your caravan
      is forced to stop and work for the day.   Lose 20 Food and Water '
